ainting by X—Christ and the Adulteress—to the powerful leader Y.\nSelling a national treasure to the Nazis could have meant the death penalty. But van Meegeren stunned investigators by claiming that the painting wasn’t a X at all. Instead, he insisted that he himself had painted it as part of a long-running forgery operation in which he created “newly discovered” works by X and other Dutch masters.\nMany experts initially refused to believe him because the paintings had already been praised by museum curators and art historians as authentic masterpieces.\nOne of the crucial pieces of evidence came from scientific analysis of the paint itself. Investigators discovered that the artwork contained a particular pigment Z that had not existed in the 17th century, but was only developed in the early 19th century—long after Vermeer’s death in 1675.\nID X Y Z", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:00:29Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Bol @⁨Abhishek Vats⁩ bol", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:00:30Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Go on sir, ek Mahatma Gandhi ka daal dena usmein bas.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:00:39Z", "username": "Dr.Namrata Srinivasan", "text": "Ded", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:00:45Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Vermeer", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:00:47Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Goring", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:00:52Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Cobalt blue", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-06T17:01:0